This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up GPIO17 as an output, and configures warnings for high-output on this pin. It reads data from the ADS1115 ADC bridge at address 0x48, converting the ADC values to pressure (kPa) and temperature (°C) using provided transfer functions. It drives the warning LED HIGH if the pressure exceeds the WARNING_THRESHOLD. The code retries failed I2C reads up to three times and handles errors gracefully. On SIGINT, it terminates the pigpio library and exits cleanly.

