This code initializes pigpio and SPI, reads the ADC value from the MCP3008, converts it to voltage, and then calculates the magnetic field strength in mT. It logs each reading to "magnetic_log.txt" and controls an LED connected to GPIO21 based on the field strength threshold. The code handles errors during initialization, SPI communication, and file operations, and cleans up resources on SIGINT.

