This code initializes the pigpio library, opens I2C bus 1, sets the address to 0x4C (MLX75030), and attempts to read the distance measurement from the sensor every 100 ms. It retries failed I2C transactions up to 3 times with a 10 ms delay between retries. The distance measurement along with a millisecond timestamp is printed to the console. On SIGINT (Ctrl+C), the program gracefully shuts down, releasing resources and terminating pigpio.

