This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up I2C communication with the VL53L1X sensor, performs a soft reset, and configures the timing budget (configuration omitted for brevity). It then enters a loop, reading the distance from the sensor every 500 ms and controlling the gate accordingly. It logs open/close events with ISO 8601 UTC timestamps. The code handles errors and releases resources on all exit paths. Note that you need to add the VL53L1X configuration code according to your specific requirements.

