            return ret;
        }

        log_temperature(ambient_temp, object_temp);
        usleep(5000000); // Sleep for 5 seconds
    }

    cleanup();
    return 0;
}
```

This code initializes the I2C bus, reads ambient and object temperatures from the MLX90614ESF-BAA sensor, logs the readings to 'temperature_log.csv', and handles errors gracefully. It also cleans up resources on SIGINT by closing the I2C file descriptor and the log file. Note that you need to install the `libgpiod` library to compile this code.

