This code initializes the pigpio library, opens I2C bus 1, and sends the Start Periodic Measurement command to the SCD40 sensor. It then enters a loop where it waits for the data-ready flag, reads the 9-byte data, verifies the CRC-8 checksum, and logs the CO2, temperature, and humidity values to 'air_quality.log' every 5 seconds. On SIGINT (Ctrl+C), it sends the Stop Periodic Measurement command, closes the I2C handle, terminates pigpio, and exits cleanly.

