This code opens the I2C bus at `/dev/i2c-1`, acquires the Omron D7S-0001 sensor at address 0x53, and samples the X, Y, and Z axis accelerations every 100 ms. It logs the data to 'vibration_log.csv' with ISO-8601 UTC timestamps. It checks every open/ioctl/read call, handles sensor-absent paths by skipping samples that return 0xFF, and gracefully handles bus errors without crashing. A SIGINT handler is installed to cleanly close the I2C file descriptor and the CSV file on Ctrl+C.

