This code initializes the libgpiod library, opens the gpiochip4 (GPIO17), configures it for input, and polls the E18-D80NK IR obstacle sensor every second. When an obstacle is detected (LOW), it logs a "self-parking sequence started" and "completed" message with timestamps. It handles SIGINT for clean shutdown and releases resources on all exit paths.

