This code initializes the I2C bus, magnetometer, and PWM for GPIO17. It reads magnetic field data from the LSM303DLHC sensor and computes the magnitude of the Z-axis field. The PWM duty cycle is adjusted based on the Z-axis magnitude, though the actual PWM control logic is left as a placeholder. The code handles errors gracefully and releases resources on SIGINT/SIGTERM.

