This code initializes the I2C and pigpio libraries, configures the ADXL345 accelerometer, and reads data every 100 ms. It detects freefall events and logs them to `freefall.log`. Upon confirmation of a freefall, it drives GPIO27 high for 5 seconds before setting it low. The code handles I2C errors and checks every pigpio and I2C call for errors. A SIGINT handler is set to close the I2C handle, set GPIO low, and terminate pigpio on interrupt.

