This code implements the line-following robot using the SunFounder 3-Way Tracking Sensor and libgpiod API on a Raspberry Pi. It polls the sensors every 10 ms, logs readings into a circular buffer, and implements line-following logic based on sensor readings. An alert system is triggered if the center sensor detects no line for 5 consecutive readings. The code handles initialization errors, resource release on exit paths, and provides placeholders for motor control functions.

