This code initializes the pigpio library, configures GPIO 4 as input and GPIO 17 as output, and implements software debouncing with a 50 ms stabilization delay. It toggles the relay state based on the touch sensor input, logging each state change with an ISO-8601 timestamp to the console. The program handles SIGINT (Ctrl+C) for graceful shutdown, turning the relay OFF, releasing pigpio resources, and printing an exit message. It checks the return value of every pigpio call and reports errors to stderr.

