This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up GPIO 4 as an output for the TTP223 touch sensor and GPIO 17 as an output for the relay. It implements a 50 ms polling-based software debounce mechanism with an optional command-line argument to override the debounce delay. Upon detecting a touch (LOW to HIGH transition), the relay state is toggled, and the change is logged with a timestamp.

