This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up the IR receiver on GPIO17, registers a callback for falling edges, decodes NEC IR signals, validates the decoded address and command, logs the results to syslog, and publishes the decoded commands as JSON to an MQTT broker. It also handles initialization failures, resource cleanup on SIGINT or SIGTERM, and guards against pulse buffer overflow.

